<title>USA: United Kingdom Fund Inc sets final div.</title>
<headline>United Kingdom Fund Inc sets final div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Kingdom Fund Inc said on Monday it revised its final distribution to $0.97 per share from a payment of $0.94 per share announced earlier this month.</p>
<p>The final distribution amount, payable on January 10 1997 to shareholders of record on December 27 1996, represents $0.36 per share from ordinary income -- including $0.15 per share from short-term gains -- and $0.61 per share from long-term capital gains.</p>
</text>
